        "• Collaborated with stakeholders across USA, UK, India, and GCC, ensuring alignment on release goals, compliance, and",
        "priorities",
        "• Chaired governance and steering meetings, ensuring transparent reporting, risk tracking, and stakeholder alignment",
        "• Mentored project leads and Scrum Masters, driving Agile adoption and high-performance team culture",
        "• Coordinated releases across multiple applications and environments, ensuring alignment between business,",
        "development, QA, and DevOps teams"
